sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Crawler / link preview<br/>(no JS)
  participant H as Human browser
  participant P as Cloudflare Pages<br/>(static files)
  participant A as Express API<br/>(JSON only)
  H->>P: GET /wiki/commodities/agricium
  P-->>H: index.html (empty shell, generic title)
  H->>P: GET /assets/app.js
  H->>A: fetch commodity data (JSON)
  A-->>H: JSON
  Note over H: React renders the page,<br/>sets title/meta/JSON-LD in the browser
  B->>P: GET /wiki/commodities/agricium
  P-->>B: same empty shell
  Note over B: Never runs JS, so it sees no content,<br/>no per-page title, no JSON-LD
